msgid ""
"In the VBA Editor (`Alt-F11`), write the code below into a VBA module. "
"`xlwings quickstart` automatically adds a new module with a sample call. If "
"you rather want to start from scratch, you can add a new module via `Insert "
"> Module`."
msgstr ""

